  "summary": "An aesthetic celebrating the mystical atmosphere of forests, featuring moss, mushrooms, dappled light, and enchanted woodland imagery.",
  "description": "Forest Magic is an aesthetic that celebrates the mystical atmosphere of forests. It features moss-covered stones, mushrooms, dappled light through canopy, ferns, and enchanted woodland imagery. The aesthetic draws from fairy tales, pagan traditions, and the Japanese concept of kodama (tree spirits). It emphasizes the liminal quality of forests as places between the mundane and the magical.",
